label line_0
[signal arg="line:0:Rin:protected"]
The latch finally opens without a fight.
label line_1
[signal arg="line:1:You:protected"]
It only took us eight years.
label line_2
[signal arg="line:2:Rin:protected"]
Some things take practice.
label line_3
[signal arg="line:3:You:protected"]
Is this still about the door?
label line_4
[signal arg="line:4:Rin:protected"]
I want to stay because I choose to. I want you to know that.
label line_5
